  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>piperacillin</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>J01CA12</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Sulaiman H et al. 2026</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>critically ill adults with sepsis or septic shock</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>piperacillin</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_piperacillin/Piperacillin_Sulaiman2026_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>CLpip (L/h)</td><td>8.78</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>Vtaz (L)</td><td>27.15</td><td>L</td><td><small>Vss</small></td></tr><tr><td>Average Vd for piperacillin</td><td>24.1</td><td>L</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr></table><h4>About piperacillin</h4><p>Piperacillin is an extended-spectrum penicillin antibiotic used to treat bacterial infections such as sepsis, urinary tract, skin, and respiratory infections, including Pseudomonas and E. coli infections. It is an approved medicine, typically given by infusion, and is often combined with tazobactam in hospital settings.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q423787\">Wikidata Q423787</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Piperacillin\">Piperacillin</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Sulaiman H et al. (2026). A multicentre evaluation of pharmacokinetic/pharmacodynamic target attainment of piperacillin and tazobactam and the association with clinical outcomes in critically ill patients with sepsis and septic shock. <i>The Journal of antimicrobial chemotherapy 81(7)</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1093/jac/dkag199\">10.1093/jac/dkag199</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/42318924\">42318924</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Sulaiman_2026: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
